powerpagecomponent.content:
{
  "description": "A true or false value. If set to true, the Last Successful Login field on the portal user's contact is stamped when they sign in. Both environments were found false on 2026-09-15 and set true. It is not cosmetic. The runbook's whole verification step is to read adx_identity_lastsuccessfullogin, and with this false that column stays null for everyone -- including accounts that demonstrably sign in -- so a working sign-in and a broken one read identically. Do not turn it off.",
  "value": "true"
}
